# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your key. .env.local is gitignored.
#
# Get a key from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey — the free tier covers
# receipt scanning comfortably for personal use. Check your project's current
# limits at https://aistudio.google.com/rate-limit
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ vars are inlined into the JS bundle at build time, which means
# this key ships inside the app and can be extracted from the IPA. Restrict it
# in Google Cloud Console (API restrictions -> Generative Language API, and an
# iOS bundle-ID restriction for com.baeyong.billsplitter) so a leaked copy is
# not usable elsewhere. Rotate it if you ever publish the build widely.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GEMINI_API_KEY=
